---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — ThaiKeto"
  description="ThaiKeto privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your information."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 mb-8">Last updated: August 12, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-thai">
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address. When you visit our site, we may collect anonymous usage data through Google Analytics, including pages visited, time on site, and referring URLs.</p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your email address to send you our newsletter with Thai keto recipes, meal plans, and product recommendations. We use analytics data to improve our content and understand what our readers find valuable.</p>

      <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use cookies for analytics and affiliate link tracking. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, though this may affect site functionality.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics for site analytics and Amazon Associates for affiliate links. These services have their own privacy policies. We use Loops for newsletter delivery.</p>

      <h2>5. Data Protection</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information. However, no internet transmission is 100% secure.</p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You can unsubscribe from our newsletter at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in any email. You can request deletion of your data by contacting us at hello@thaiketo.com.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at hello@thaiketo.com.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
